{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"508302","name":"元素幻变：火岩祝佑","desc":"元素幻变：火岩祝佑","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/08/80663279/5d480884a12c541a1b29844f5ffa67c3_8435812920530978515.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基础信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"moduleName\":\"基础信息\",\"layout_\":\"left\",\"name\":\"元素幻变：火岩祝佑\",\"common_img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/08/80663279/5d480884a12c541a1b29844f5ffa67c3_5625649056324702367.png\",\"gold_img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/06/18/258999284/3ce7c79f6bce645229b421d06e156825_612226116872849374.gif\",\"life\":2,\"life_bg\":9,\"energy\":0,\"energy_bg\":0,\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"类型：\",\"value\":[\"支援牌\"]},{\"key\":\"标签：\",\"value\":[\"元素幻变\"]},{\"key\":\"获取：\",\"value\":[\"卡牌商店购买获取\"]},{\"key\":\"花费：\",\"value\":[\"2\"]}],\"baseInfoSwitchDisabled\":false}","style":""}],"id":"1","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"效果描述","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003e元素幻变\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;元素幻变：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;行动阶段开始时，若队伍中包含元素幻变的两种元素类型的角色且不包含其他元素的角色，则将此牌抓起，然后弃置并生成至场上，然后将4个骰子转化为幻变的元素类型。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e：\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(207, 19, 34)\\\"\u003e火元素\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(212, 177, 6)\\\"\u003e岩元素\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e投掷阶段：\u003c/strong\u003e总是投出2个\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(207, 19, 34)\\\"\u003e火元素骰\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e和2个\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(212, 177, 6)\\\"\u003e岩元素骰\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e我方触发火结晶反应后\u003c/strong\u003e：弃置此牌并从\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003e火岩祝佑·回火\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;火岩祝佑·回火：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;支援牌\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;投掷阶段：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;总是投出2个\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(207, 19, 34)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;火元素骰\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;和2个\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(212, 177, 6)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;岩元素骰\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;我方场上存在\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;u\u0026gt;护盾\u0026lt;/u\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;角色状态或\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;护盾\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;出战状态时，造成的\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(207, 19, 34)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;u\u0026gt;火元素伤害\u0026lt;/u\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;和\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(212, 177, 6)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;u\u0026gt;岩元素伤害\u0026lt;/u\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;+1。（每回合3次）\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;hr\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;护盾：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;此护盾所保护的角色受到伤害时，将会消耗护盾来抵消伤害。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;hr\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(207, 19, 34)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;火元素伤害：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;附着火元素，可发生元素反应：\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;融化：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;本伤害+2\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;蒸发：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;本伤害+2\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;超载：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;本伤害+2，目标强制切换到下一个角色\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;燃烧：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;本伤害+1，生成回合结束时造成1点火伤害的[\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;燃烧烈焰\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;]（可生效1次，最多叠加到2次）\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;hr\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(212, 177, 6)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;岩元素伤害\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;和已附着的元素发生元素反应：\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;结晶（冰）\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;：本伤害+1，我方出战角色获得1点护盾（可叠加，最多2点）。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;结晶（水）\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;：本伤害+1，我方出战角色获得1点护盾（可叠加，最多2点）。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;结晶（火）\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;：本伤害+1，我方出战角色获得1点护盾（可叠加，最多2点）。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;结晶（雷）\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;：本伤害+1，我方出战角色获得1点护盾（可叠加，最多2点）。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e和\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003e火岩祝佑·重熔\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;火岩祝佑·重熔：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;支援牌\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;投掷阶段：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;总是投出2个\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(207, 19, 34)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;火元素骰\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;和2个\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(212, 177, 6)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;岩元素骰\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;敌方受到\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(207, 19, 34)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;u\u0026gt;火元素伤害\u0026lt;/u\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;或\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(212, 177, 6)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;\u0026lt;u\u0026gt;岩元素伤害\u0026lt;/u\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;后：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;我方生成2层\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;护盾\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;。（每回合1次）\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;hr\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(207, 19, 34)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;火元素伤害：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;附着火元素，可发生元素反应：\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;融化：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;本伤害+2\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;蒸发：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;本伤害+2\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;超载：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;本伤害+2，目标强制切换到下一个角色\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;燃烧：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;本伤害+1，生成回合结束时造成1点火伤害的[\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;燃烧烈焰\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;]（可生效1次，最多叠加到2次）\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;hr\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(212, 177, 6)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;岩元素伤害\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;和已附着的元素发生元素反应：\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;结晶（冰）\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;：本伤害+1，我方出战角色获得1点护盾（可叠加，最多2点）。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;结晶（水）\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;：本伤害+1，我方出战角色获得1点护盾（可叠加，最多2点）。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;结晶（火）\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;：本伤害+1，我方出战角色获得1点护盾（可叠加，最多2点）。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;结晶（雷）\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;：本伤害+1，我方出战角色获得1点护盾（可叠加，最多2点）。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e中挑选一项加入手牌。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"2","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"卡牌故事","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e元素幻变：火岩祝佑\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e火岩同铸，坚毅不灭。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"6632","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":true,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"强力支援","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"6633","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":tru